[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946636275","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107165#issuecomment-2946636275","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107165","id":2946636275,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vohnz","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-05T22:36:06Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T22:36:06Z","body":"[Upon request](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/navigation?msg=LaE6LBFhh3hgpqiLk) I have partially reverted the use of \"meters\" in the navigation classes.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946636275/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2948534397","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107165#issuecomment-2948534397","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107165","id":2948534397,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vvxB9","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-06T08:45:37Z","updated_at":"2025-06-06T08:45:37Z","body":"As a confirmation of the general correctness of this we have the [documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/3d/introduction_to_3d.html#coordinate-system):\r\n> Godot uses the metric system for everything in 3D, with 1 unit being equal to 1 meter. Physics and other areas are tuned for this scale. Therefore, attempting to use a different scale is usually a bad idea (unless you know what you are doing).\r\n\r\nBut I think it's still worth discussing codifying this as it might be confusing when you simply scale the world conceptually, or by changing settings, though it is specified in the editor interface","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2948534397/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2948583286","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107165#issuecomment-2948583286","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107165","id":2948583286,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vv892","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-06T09:03:51Z","updated_at":"2025-06-06T09:03:51Z","body":"If I wasnt clear enough on this in the discussion I dont agree on this change.\r\n\r\nA world unit is always the correct answer for the technical documentation because it is in fact an engine world unit that can be something arbitrary because nothing forces or enforces it to be remapped to a metric. Even some of the old doc that is replaced in this PR considered the possibility of this being arbitrary and changeable.\r\n\r\nIt is technically wrong to call it a meter in the technical documentation. Call it a meter or whatever \"easy-to-grasp\" name in the toddler sandbox tutorial if you must.\r\n\r\nOther engines understand this, that is why in e.g. Unreal Engine has a Unreal Unit (UU) as the unit because the engine is in UU. A lot of the doc say how many UU it is. That there are tables that can be used by importers and exporters to convert assets to other metrics is one thing, at the end of the day it is still an engine world unit.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2948583286/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2948658085","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107165#issuecomment-2948658085","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107165","id":2948658085,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vwPOl","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-06T09:32:58Z","updated_at":"2025-06-06T09:32:58Z","body":"In that case, neither should some \"pixels\" and \"meters\" be defined as such in the existing class reference, and should be changed accordingly. Whatever ends up being done, what matters to me is that everyone comes to a consistent decision.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2948658085/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]